{"title":"Career Roadmap · Reporter","role":"Reporter","summary":"A Reporter researches, verifies, investigates and presents news for newspapers, digital news platforms, television, radio, magazines and specialised media organisations.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (General / Honours)","Course":"Journalism & Mass Communication"},"about":[{"label":"Education","text":"Undergraduate"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Reporter researches, verifies, investigates and presents news for newspapers, digital news platforms, television, radio, magazines and specialised media organisations."},{"type":"p","text":"This is a strong direct alignment with a BA in Journalism & Mass Communication. Unlike careers that require a highly specialised postgraduate degree, reporting can be entered directly after graduation if the student develops strong reporting skills, a portfolio, newsroom experience and digital-media capabilities."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Reporter does"},{"type":"p","text":"A professional reporter may:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Identify and research news stories"},{"text":"Conduct interviews with sources and experts"},{"text":"Attend press conferences and events"},{"text":"Verify facts and documents"},{"text":"Write news reports and headlines"},{"text":"Cover breaking news and developing stories"},{"text":"Report from the field"},{"text":"Use public records and data for investigations"},{"text":"Produce video, audio and photo-based stories"},{"text":"Work with editors and newsroom teams"},{"text":"Follow journalistic ethics and source-protection principles"},{"text":"Publish stories across web, print, television or social platforms"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Career positioning"},{"type":"table","header":["Aspect","Reality"],"rows":[[{"text":"Degree alignment"},{"text":"Excellent"}],[{"text":"Direct entry after UG"},{"text":"Yes"}],[{"text":"Portfolio importance"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Internship importance"},{"text":"Very High"}],[{"text":"Communication skills"},{"text":"Critical"}],[{"text":"Research/fact-checking"},{"text":"Critical"}],[{"text":"Digital skills"},{"text":"Increasingly essential"}],[{"text":"PG requirement"},{"text":"Usually optional for entry"}],[{"text":"AI impact"},{"text":"High, but mainly changes workflow rather than eliminating the need for reporters"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Students Should Learn During the Degree","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Journalism Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on understanding how news is created and communicated."},{"type":"h","text":"Core knowledge"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Introduction to journalism"},{"text":"Mass communication"},{"text":"News values"},{"text":"Types of journalism"},{"text":"Media ethics"},{"text":"Indian media landscape"},{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Feature writing"},{"text":"Basic reporting"},{"text":"Communication theory"},{"text":"Media law fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Practical skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"Headline writing"},{"text":"Interview preparation"},{"text":"Note-taking"},{"text":"Basic photography"},{"text":"Mobile journalism"},{"text":"Basic video recording"},{"text":"Public speaking"},{"text":"English and/or regional-language writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"First portfolio project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small student news portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"5 local news reports"},{"text":"2 interviews"},{"text":"1 feature article"},{"text":"1 photo story"},{"text":"1 short video report"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Become a Practical Reporter","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should move beyond classroom assignments and start reporting real events."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investigative journalism fundamentals"},{"text":"Political reporting"},{"text":"Business reporting"},{"text":"Crime reporting"},{"text":"Education reporting"},{"text":"Health reporting"},{"text":"Sports reporting"},{"text":"Environment reporting"},{"text":"Data journalism"},{"text":"Digital journalism"},{"text":"Photojournalism"},{"text":"Video journalism"},{"text":"Social-media journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Find primary sources"},{"text":"Verify information"},{"text":"Cross-check claims"},{"text":"Read government documents"},{"text":"Analyse reports and datasets"},{"text":"Conduct interviews"},{"text":"Identify conflicts of interest"},{"text":"Distinguish fact from opinion"},{"text":"Track developing stories"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Tools"},{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Tools"],"rows":[[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Google Docs, Microsoft Word"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Google, official government portals, public databases"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, Google Sheets"}],[{"text":"Visualisation"},{"text":"Datawrapper, Flourish"}],[{"text":"Design"},{"text":"Canva, Figma"}],[{"text":"Video"},{"text":"DaVinci Resolve, Premiere Pro, CapCut"}],[{"text":"Audio"},{"text":"Audacity, Adobe Audition"}],[{"text":"CMS"},{"text":"WordPress"}],[{"text":"Analytics"},{"text":"Google Analytics, Search Console"}],[{"text":"Social"},{"text":"Instagram, YouTube, X, LinkedIn"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Develop a Reporting Specialisation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By the third year, students should choose one or two areas in which they want to become particularly strong."},{"type":"h","text":"Possible specialisations"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Typical Coverage"],"rows":[[{"text":"Political Reporter"},{"text":"Elections, parties, government, policy"}],[{"text":"Crime Reporter"},{"text":"Crime, police, courts, investigations"}],[{"text":"Business Reporter"},{"text":"Companies, markets, economy"}],[{"text":"Financial Reporter"},{"text":"Banking, investments, finance"}],[{"text":"Technology Reporter"},{"text":"AI, software, startups, cybersecurity"}],[{"text":"Science Reporter"},{"text":"Research, medicine, science"}],[{"text":"Health Reporter"},{"text":"Healthcare, public health"}],[{"text":"Sports Reporter"},{"text":"Sports, athletes, tournaments"}],[{"text":"Education Reporter"},{"text":"Schools, universities, education policy"}],[{"text":"Environment Reporter"},{"text":"Climate, pollution, biodiversity"}],[{"text":"Investigative Reporter"},{"text":"Deep research and document-based stories"}],[{"text":"Data Journalist"},{"text":"Data-driven reporting"}],[{"text":"Entertainment Reporter"},{"text":"Film, television, celebrities"}],[{"text":"Political Correspondent"},{"text":"Long-term political coverage"}],[{"text":"Foreign Correspondent"},{"text":"International affairs"}],[{"text":"Photojournalist"},{"text":"Visual reporting"}],[{"text":"Multimedia Reporter"},{"text":"Text + video + audio + graphics"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Strong recommendation"},{"type":"p","text":"For the AI era, students should consider combining:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Journalism","Data","Technology","Multimedia"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology Reporter","Data Journalism","AI literacy"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a stronger professional profile than relying only on traditional news writing."}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Primary Goal","Skills","Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Journalism fundamentals"},{"text":"News writing, interviewing, media ethics"},{"text":"10–15 articles"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Practical reporting"},{"text":"Research, field reporting, video, photography"},{"text":"20+ published/portfolio stories"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Specialisation"},{"text":"Investigative/data/beat reporting"},{"text":"3–5 major stories"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Employment readiness"},{"text":"Portfolio, newsroom workflow, multimedia"},{"text":"Professional journalism portfolio"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A journalism student should build a real reporting portfolio, not just academic assignments."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Local News Series"},{"type":"p","text":"Cover 10–15 stories from:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Transportation"},{"text":"Local government"},{"text":"Environment"},{"text":"Business"},{"text":"Public infrastructure"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Investigative Story"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"How does waste management work in a city?\""},{"type":"p","text":"Research:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government data"},{"text":"Municipal reports"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Field observations"},{"text":"Public expenditure"},{"text":"Citizen complaints"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Written story"},{"text":"Interview clips"},{"text":"Photographs"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Data Journalism"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"\"How have fuel prices changed over five years?\""},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government/public datasets"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Python or R"},{"text":"Datawrapper/Flourish"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Written explanation"},{"text":"Visual story"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Video News Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Produce a 3–5 minute report containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Anchor introduction"},{"text":"Field footage"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Voice-over"},{"text":"B-roll"},{"text":"Captions"},{"text":"Fact verification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Digital News Publication"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a small website covering a niche such as:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","AI","Startups"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Publish 20–30 original stories."},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates:"},{"type":"flow","items":["reporting","writing","CMS","SEO","multimedia","audience analytics."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Skills Employers Look For","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Importance"],"rows":[[{"text":"News writing"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Interviewing"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Current affairs"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Source development"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Story judgement"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Digital journalism"},{"text":"★★★★★"}],[{"text":"Video reporting"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Photography"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Data journalism"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}],[{"text":"Social media"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"AI literacy"},{"text":"★★★★☆"}],[{"text":"Graphic design"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}],[{"text":"Audio/podcast production"},{"text":"★★★☆☆"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are particularly important for journalism because newsroom experience demonstrates that the student can work under deadlines, editorial standards and real reporting conditions."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Newspapers"},{"text":"Digital news organisations"},{"text":"Television news channels"},{"text":"Radio organisations"},{"text":"Magazines"},{"text":"News agencies"},{"text":"Business media"},{"text":"Sports media"},{"text":"Technology publications"},{"text":"Local news organisations"},{"text":"Investigative journalism organisations"},{"text":"Government/public-information organisations"},{"text":"Research organisations"},{"text":"Think tanks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Editorial Intern"},{"text":"Reporting Intern"},{"text":"News Intern"},{"text":"Digital Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Research Intern"},{"text":"Content Intern"},{"text":"Social Media Intern"},{"text":"Video Journalism Intern"},{"text":"Fact-Checking Intern"},{"text":"Data Journalism Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal internship progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Campus/local publication","Year 2: Digital/news organisation","Year 3: Established newsroom or specialist publication","Year 4: Pre-placement newsroom internship"],"label":"Year 1"}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Additional Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Formal certifications are less important than a strong journalism portfolio, but additional training can strengthen employability."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital Journalism"},{"text":"Investigative Journalism"},{"text":"Data Journalism"},{"text":"Fact-checking"},{"text":"Mobile Journalism"},{"text":"Photojournalism"},{"text":"Video Journalism"},{"text":"SEO"},{"text":"Data Analysis"},{"text":"Media Ethics"},{"text":"Media Law"},{"text":"Digital Storytelling"},{"text":"AI for Journalism"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical stack"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong modern reporter could learn:"},{"type":"p","text":"Writing\n→ Word/Google Docs"},{"type":"p","text":"Data\n→ Excel → SQL → Python/R"},{"type":"p","text":"Visualisation\n→ Datawrapper → Flourish"},{"type":"p","text":"Video\n→ DaVinci Resolve/Premiere"},{"type":"p","text":"Audio\n→ Audacity/Adobe Audition"},{"type":"p","text":"Publishing\n→ WordPress/CMS"},{"type":"p","text":"Analytics\n→ Google Analytics/Search Console"},{"type":"p","text":"AI\n→ AI research tools → transcription → summarisation → data assistance → verification workflows"},{"type":"p","text":"The important principle is:"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can assist journalism; it should not replace verification and editorial judgement."}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Get After Graduation","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should not restrict the search only to jobs titled Reporter."},{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Reporter"},{"text":"Junior Reporter"},{"text":"Trainee Reporter"},{"text":"News Reporter"},{"text":"Staff Reporter"},{"text":"Digital Reporter"},{"text":"Correspondent Trainee"},{"text":"Editorial Assistant"},{"text":"News Desk Assistant"},{"text":"Content Journalist"},{"text":"Multimedia Journalist"},{"text":"Video Journalist"},{"text":"Researcher"},{"text":"Fact-Checking Associate"},{"text":"News Researcher"},{"text":"Digital News Producer"},{"text":"Social Media Journalist"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialist entry roles"},{"type":"p","text":"With a relevant portfolio:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology Reporter"},{"text":"Business Reporter"},{"text":"Sports Reporter"},{"text":"Education Reporter"},{"text":"Environment Reporter"},{"text":"Health Reporter"},{"text":"Data Journalism Associate"},{"text":"Investigative Journalism Assistant"},{"text":"Political Reporting Assistant"}]}]},{"heading":"What Makes a Graduate Employable?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A journalism graduate should ideally leave college with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Minimum employability stack"},{"type":"p","text":"Journalism fundamentals\n+\nExcellent writing\n+\nInterviewing\n+\nFact-checking\n+\nCurrent affairs\n+\nDigital journalism\n+\nVideo/mobile journalism\n+\nBasic data analysis\n+\nPortfolio\n+\nInternship experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Stronger AI-era profile"},{"type":"flow","items":["Reporter","Data Journalist","Multimedia Producer","AI-literate Researcher"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"This combination provides considerably more flexibility than traditional text-only reporting."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in Ind